[E-POSITIVITY] Error: field `same` depends on `n`, whose type contains `Fnat`
    ╭─[ soundness/nested-recursive-field.sw:12:38 ]
    │
 12 │   | FSucc (n: Fnat) (m: Fnat) (same: n = m)
    │                                      ──┬──  
    │                                        ╰──── `same`'s type mentions `n`
